"strut\" style=\"height:0.9814em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8981em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>ICP 对初值敏感、易陷局部最优，因此实践中先用<strong>全局配准</strong>（如基于 FPFH 特征的 RANSAC 匹配）给出粗位姿，再用 ICP 精修。这条&quot;全局粗配准 + ICP 精配准&quot;的流水线是经典 6D 位姿估计的骨架，但它要求已知物体模型且对遮挡敏感——深度学习方法正是为突破这些限制而生，详见下一篇。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[原始点云] --&gt; B[体素降采样]&#10;    B --&gt; C[统计离群点去除]&#10;    C --&gt; D[RANSAC 平面分割&lt;br/&gt;移除桌面]&#10;    D --&gt; E[欧氏聚类&lt;br/&gt;分出物体实例]&#10;    E --&gt; F[全局配准 FPFH+RANSAC&lt;br/&gt;粗位姿]&#10;    F --&gt; G[ICP 精配准&lt;br/&gt;精位姿]&#10;    G --&gt; H[供位姿估计 / 抓取检测]\">flowchart TD\n    A[原始点云] --&gt; B[体素降采样]\n    B --&gt; C[统计离群点去除]\n    C --&gt; D[RANSAC 平面分割&lt;br/&gt;移除桌面]\n    D --&gt; E[欧氏聚类&lt;br/&gt;分出物体实例]\n    E --&gt; F[全局配准 FPFH+RANSAC&lt;br/&gt;粗位姿]\n    F --&gt; G[ICP 精配准&lt;br/&gt;精位姿]\n    G --&gt; H[供位姿估计 / 抓取检测]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RGB-D 相机用结构光、ToF 或双目立体提供深度，三者在距离、强光鲁棒性、精度上各有取舍。</li>\n<li>深度图经相机内参反投影成点云，再经手眼标定外参进入机器人坐标系，标定精度直接决定抓取落点精度。</li>\n<li>点云处理标准流程是降采样、离群去除、直通裁剪，主流工具是 Open3D 与 PCL。</li>\n<li>RANSAC 平面分割移除桌面、欧氏聚类分出物体实例，输出供下游使用；迭代次数由内点比例定量决定。</li>\n<li>&quot;全局粗配准 + ICP 精配准&quot;是经典 6D 位姿估计骨架，但依赖已知模型、对遮挡敏感，引出<a href=\"6d-pose-estimation\">6D 物体位姿估计</a>的深度学习方法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RGB-D 与点云处理","id":"rgb-d-与点云处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"深度图到点云的反投影","id":"深度图到点云的反投影"},{"level":2,"text":"点云滤波与降采样","id":"点云滤波与降采样"},{"level":2,"text":"平面分割与聚类","id":"平面分割与聚类"},{"level":2,"text":"点云配准与 ICP","id":"点云配准与-icp"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"抓取质量度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/grasp-mechanics/grasp-quality-metrics"},"next":{"title":"6D 物体位姿估计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/perception-pose/6d-pose-estimation"}}